window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>A new kind of gift exchange…</i></b></p> <p>My life has never been typical. Most people weren’t professional ballerinas. Most people didn’t have two happily married, four century old dads and an aunt who was actually your mother. Most people didn’t have pointed ears they had to hide or wings that would pop out of their back when they got too excited or angry. Most people didn’t have my problems.</p> <p>But it turned out, I had the same mundane human problems as them.</p> <p>My boyfriend cheated on me. My best friend lost her job. My two other roommates refused to grow up. And I was suddenly twenty-five and realizing I wasn’t happy. I was, however, the type of girl who solved her own problems. I just need to get away from my life for a while to clear my mind. Thanks to the Neverland Classified app, I found myself the perfect little cottage in Megelle Island to run away to for Christmas.</p> <p>No work, no stress, and absolutely no boys. It’s the perfect plan, what could go wrong?</p> <p><b>*Part of a mini-series but can be listened to as a standalone, in any order with the others</b></p>"; 
